# Edit sound

- Music voice file mein mat milaao. Edit pe `episode.json` mein lagao. Default `assets/music/chill-tech-01.mp3`, volume `0.12`. Build voice bolte waqt music dheema kar deta hai.
- Hook shuru (`at: 0.0`) pe zoom SFX `assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3`, volume `0.4`. Doosri jagah tabhi jab us scene ka visual punch zoom ho.
- Filler reaction SFX mat lagao (`faaah`, `vine-boom`).
- Flow clip ka audio mute. Bolne wali awaaz `episodes/epNNN/voice.mp3` se aati hai.
